<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL - STOCKS TRADE EX-DIV, EX-BONUS WEDS.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - STOCKS TRADE EX-DIV, EX-BONUS WEDS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>shares of Technodomi will trade ex-dividend on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>    COMPANY	    DIVIDEND/SHARE    ADJUSTED STARTING PRICE</p>
<p>    Technodomi	   105		     1,845</p>
<p>Also on Wednesday, shares of Mohlos and Olympic</p>
<p>Technical will trade ex-bonus.</p>
<p>    COMPANY	    ADJUSTED PRICE    BONUS TERMS</p>
<p>    Mohlos		 1,000	     5 bonus per 10 held</p>
<p>    Olympic Technical    967	     2 bonus per 10 held</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
